    <string name="permission_rationale_title">Aura needs a few permissions</string>
    <string name="permission_rationale_body">Microphone: to record. Notifications: so you can always see when Aura is recording. Phone state (optional): so recording pauses by itself during a call. You can say no to the last two and Aura will still record.</string>
