    <string name="onboarding_welcome_title">Welcome to Aura</string>
    <string name="onboarding_welcome_body">Aura records your meetings and conversations, even with the screen off. If you want, it then turns each recording into a transcript that says who spoke, and a written note. You choose who does the processing, and nothing leaves your phone until you say so.</string>
